            </p>

            <h5 class="h6 fw-bold mt-4 mb-2">3-Tier Low-Latency Execution Pipeline:</h5>
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <div>
                    <h5 class="h6 fw-bold mb-1">Tier 1: Instant Engine (&lt; 20ms)</h5>
